# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# S7 Agent — Environment Configuration
# Copy this to .env (same directory) and fill in real values.
# The agent connects to Gateway V7 on port 8107; the gateway holds most keys.
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Search providers ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Tavily: primary web search (950/month free tier)
TAVILY_API_KEY=tvly-your-key-here

# DuckDuckGo is used automatically as fallback — no key needed.

# ── Gateway (auto-started on port 8107 if not running) ────────────────────────
# The agent starts Gateway V7 automatically. Gateway keys go in Gateway/.env.
# Set this only to override the auto-start URL.
# GATEWAY_URL=http://localhost:8107
